messages[11]{user,text}:
  user_2,Hi Sneha, this is Anjali from First Guard Brokers, calling about your auto policy renewal—just wanted to confirm you got the documents.
  user_1,Oh hi Anjali, yeah I got the email, I... uh... I signed the forms earlier today.
  user_2,Great! So we’re all set. Just to double‑check, the policy will be effective from 01/10/2026, right?
  user_1,Yes, that's what I saw. But— um— I wanted to ask about the payment schedule—when is the first premium due?
  user_2,Sure, the first premium is due within 10 days of the effective date, so by 10/10/2026. You can pay online or we can set up auto‑debit.
  user_1,Okay, I think I'll do the auto‑debit. Can you set that up now?
  user_2,I can definitely start the process—I'll need your bank details. Do you have them handy?
  user_1,[sighs] Yeah, let me pull them up... okay, it's 123456789, ABC Bank, checking.
  user_2,Got it, thank you. I’ll send you a confirmation email shortly. Anything else you need?
  user_1,No, that's all. Thanks!
  user_2,You’re welcome! Have a great day.